github-ninja bundles skills copied from these upstream repositories. Each copied skill folder
keeps the upstream licence as LICENSE.txt. The exact upstream commit of each skill is in its
SKILL.md under metadata.upstream (kept current by .github/workflows/upstream-sync.yml).

github/awesome-copilot (MIT, Copyright GitHub, Inc.)
  skills/github-actions-hardening
  skills/github-actions-efficiency
  skills/github-actions-runtime-upgrade-conventions
  skills/dependabot
  skills/secret-scanning
  skills/codeql

cli/cli (MIT, Copyright (c) 2019 GitHub Inc.)
  skills/gh

Local changes to copied skills: a `metadata` block (version, upstream) added to each SKILL.md
frontmatter. Any further local edit is listed here.
